    <note type="translation" xml:lang="en">Bayram al-Turkī, one of those in whom people believed (al-muʿtaqadīn, i.e. popularly venerated men). He resided at the Mosque of al-Ḥākim. He died in Jumādā al-Thāniya 864 and was buried in the turba of Jānī Bak al-Mashadd. Al-Munīr recorded his death date.</note>
